-This is executed as three sequential GPU kernel calls [S2].
+Where $\times_n$ denotes the n-mode product. The sequential steps are:
+1.  $B' = B \times_1 U^{(1)}$
+2.  $B'' = B' \times_2 U^{(2)}$
+3.  $A_f = B'' \times_3 U^{(3)}$
 
